#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Qiskit to create a circuit that transforms the state $|0\\rangle$ to the state $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}|0\\rangle + \\frac{1}{2}e^{i \\frac{5\\pi}{6}}|1\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "Utilise Qiskit pour créer un circuit qui transforme l'état $|0\\rangle$ en l'état $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}|0\\rangle + \\frac{1}{2}e^{i \\frac{5\\pi}{6}}|1\\rangle$\n"
